{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows资源管理器拉起可疑子进程。对应需求：初始访问。官方：Suspicious Explorer Child Process。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process-*","winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows资源管理器拉起可疑子进程","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows资源管理器拉起可疑子进程\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"9a5b4e31-6cde-4295-9ff7-6be1b8567e1b","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  (\n   process.name : (\"cscript.exe\", \"wscript.exe\", \"powershell.exe\", \"rundll32.exe\", \"cmd.exe\", \"mshta.exe\", \"regsvr32.exe\") or\n   ?process.pe.original_file_name in (\"cscript.exe\", \"wscript.exe\", \"PowerShell.EXE\", \"RUNDLL32.EXE\", \"Cmd.Exe\", \"MSHTA.EXE\", \"REGSVR32.EXE\")\n  ) and\n  /* Explorer started via DCOM */\n  process.parent.name : \"explorer.exe\" and process.parent.args : \"-Embedding\" and\n  not process.parent.args:\n          (\n            /* Noisy CLSID_SeparateSingleProcessExplorerHost Explorer COM Class IDs   */\n            \"/factory,{5BD95610-9434-43C2-886C-57852CC8A120}\",\n            \"/factory,{ceff45ee-c862-41de-aee2-a022c81eda92}\"\n          )\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1566","name":"Phishing","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1566.001","name":"Spearphishing Attachment","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/001/"},{"id":"T1566.002","name":"Spearphishing Link","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"},{"id":"T1059.003","name":"Windows Command Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/003/"},{"id":"T1059.005","name":"Visual Basic","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/005/"}]},{"id":"T1559","name":"Inter-Process Communication","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1559/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1559.001","name":"Component Object Model","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1559/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1218","name":"System Binary Proxy Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1218.005","name":"Mshta","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/005/"},{"id":"T1218.010","name":"Regsvr32","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/010/"},{"id":"T1218.011","name":"Rundll32","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/011/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":316,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
